<!-- The provider's whole "atmosphere" group: mist, fog, haze, smoke, dust, sand, ash.

     Four staggered bands rather than anything more literal, because the group's members differ
     in cause and not in appearance, and a glyph that tried to distinguish them would be claiming
     a precision the icon does not have. -->
